# Autonomous capabilities JARVIS writes for itself (runtime artifacts).
# Deliberately NOT committed: they are machine-local, generated code, and the
# registry recreates the directory at boot. Commit them only if you want a
# self-built feature to survive a redeploy on an ephemeral filesystem.
capabilities/*.py
capabilities/manifest.json

# God's Eye View sidecar (vendored in godseye/, see godseye/JARVIS-INTEGRATION.md)
godseye/node_modules/
godseye/.logs/
godseye/dist/